  "question": {
    "text": "The value of ' \\(a\\) ' for which the scalar triple product formed by the vectors \\(\\vec{a}=\\hat{i}+a \\hat{j}+\\hat{k}, \\vec{\\beta}=\\hat{j}+a \\hat{k}\\) and \\(\\vec{\\gamma}=a \\hat{i}+\\hat{k}\\) is maximum, is",
