  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Hint : \\(\\Delta=1+\\mathrm{a}^3-\\mathrm{a}\\) For \\(\\max ; \\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\Delta}{\\mathrm{da}}=0\\)\n\\(\\frac{\\mathrm{d} \\Delta}{\\mathrm{da}}=3 \\mathrm{a}^2-1 \\quad \\mathrm{a}= \\pm \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\)\n\\(\\frac{\\mathrm{d}^2 \\Delta}{\\mathrm{da}^2}=6 \\mathrm{a}  < 0\\) for \\(\\mathrm{a}=-\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}\\)",
